{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the BOSSFIGHT when you win!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenge yourself (literally!) as you try to one-up your previous party each time though this sidescrolling turn-based roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Outsmart enemy intents in a series of tactical combat encounters while assembling synergistic item builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover the nuances in this highly replayable game, lovingly designed to minimize complexity and maximize depth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/f2f8d345b891dcfbeaa0221b129bd639.poster.avif?t=1756111871\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/f2f8d345b891dcfbeaa0221b129bd639.webm?t=1756111871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/f2f8d345b891dcfbeaa0221b129bd639.mp4?t=1756111871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Items, items, items!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Bossfight Tactics, it's all about the items; there are no character classes/abilities/stats/etc!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Items let you move, attack, gain passive abilities and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With 100+ unique and quirky items, there are tons of emergent interactions to explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/30c065717723c29a6bd214d540d4f8be.poster.avif?t=1756111871\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/30c065717723c29a6bd214d540d4f8be.webm?t=1756111871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/30c065717723c29a6bd214d540d4f8be.mp4?t=1756111871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Instead of fixed movesets, enemies are equipped with random items which drop as loot when defeated.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounters are therefore always unique, often surprising, and sometimes hilarious!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beware though, enemies grow stronger too as you unlock more powerful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Inspired by <i>Into the Breach</i> and <i>Slay the Spire</i>, enemies make their intents known, allowing you to plan and outmaneuver them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/e79c9436e13cac7696595cc418aa1941.poster.avif?t=1756111871\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/e79c9436e13cac7696595cc418aa1941.webm?t=1756111871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635710/extras/e79c9436e13cac7696595cc418aa1941.mp4?t=1756111871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Adapt on the fly by tossing the perfect item to an ally in a critical moment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or maybe just lob a bomb toward your enemies?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A simple and intuitive interface that welcomes players new to the genre!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlimited undos for carefree experimentation and those misclick moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An optional Auto-Battle button in case your brain has melted from all that strategizing. Also useful for discovering interesting moves. (Kinda like ChatGPT for turn-based tactics.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No story or cut-scenes; every moment an interesting decision!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Victory!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1635710/a838f275a5dc3537dfe33ebe047a3622e16697b0.jpg"},{"name":"Mule","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1635710/dee72994e1419ddeee821eb29c7c7bf0e0ee6971.jpg"},{"name":"Bow of Swapping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1635710/e11dcd1351835ff7b480cce428177eaf1d5f091d.jpg"},{"name":"Meteorite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1635710/c9a68f609e46dc75acb30a1667b4e080c6cef287.jpg"},{"name":"Reusable Bomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1635710/2ac79543d056a138cc9eaa85d338a0583fb1f7d2.jpg"},{"name":"Bazooka","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1635710/170cf53149c746e9932049224199615f59ebe670.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Purse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1635710/fca691ca9149c57d8a31a000052a7fe678870d11.jpg"},{"name":"Shield Basher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1635710/d1ba3309c3cbd904185cf65e7ba00e7fe8426fb8.jpg"},{"name":"Lover's Scorn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1635710/de9fa39cdcf28938513116ac9775b44edc2af856.jpg"},{"name":"Battering Ram","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima